    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>朽木妖</b>（日文︰<b><span lang=\"ja\">オーロット</span></b>，英文︰<b>Trevenant</b>）是一張<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%89%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"草（TCG）\">草</a>屬性的<a href=\"/wiki/1%E9%98%B6%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"1階進化寶可夢（TCG）\">1階進化寶可夢</a>卡。\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"zh-Hant\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">目次</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#卡牌信息\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">卡牌資訊</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#收录卡包\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">收錄卡包</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#中文卡包\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><span><b>中文卡包</b></span></span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#日文和英文卡包\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\"><span><b>日文和英文卡包</b></span></span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#细节\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">細節</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span id=\".E5.8D.A1.E7.89.8C.E4.BF.A1.E6.81.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"卡牌信息\">卡牌資訊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%9C%BD%E6%9C%A8%E5%A6%96%EF%BC%88S2%EF%BC%89&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：卡牌資訊\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E6%9C%BD%E6%9C%A8%E5%A6%96%EF%BC%88S2%EF%BC%89&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節的原始碼： 卡牌資訊\"><span>編輯原始碼</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"bg-草C bd-草C roundy-15 at-c a-c\" style=\"border-width:3px;max-width:500px;width:100%;&#124;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table width=\"100%\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-草C bgl-钢 textblack at-c\" style=\"letter-spacing:0.2em;color:initial;width:20%;white-space:nowrap;\" rowspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/1%E9%98%B6%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"1階進化寶可夢（TCG）\">1階進化</a></b><br /><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E6%9C%A8%E7%81%B5\" title=\"小木靈\"><span class=\"sprite-pm sprite-icon sprite-icon-708\" title=\"小木靈\"></span></a>\n</td>\n<th class=\"roundybr-25 bg-魂银 bd-草C\" style=\"padding-top:6px; line-height:30px;\"><div style=\"float:left;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9C%BD%E6%9C%A8%E5%A6%96\" title=\"朽木妖\">朽木妖</a></span></div> <div style=\"float:right;\">&#160;&#160;</div>\n</th>\n<td class=\"at-r va-c\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\" rowspan=\"2\"><span class=\"va-c\"><b><span style=\"font-size:1em;\">HP</span><span style=\"font-size:27px;\">130</span></b></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%89%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"草（TCG）\"><img alt=\"草\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/30px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/45px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/60px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"roundyleft-6 roundyright-20 at-l\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;height:1em;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\">從<a href=\"/wiki/Category:%E5%B0%8F%E6%9C%A8%E7%81%B5%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"Category:小木靈（TCG）\">小木靈</a>進化\n</td>\n<td style=\"display:none;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"textwhite a-r at-c roundybr-30\" style=\"color:initial;font-size:0.9em;width:100%;background: -webkit-linear-gradient(left,#e7c4da 3%, #b1e1f5 50%, #cce7c8 100%); display:none;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/b/b1/%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97_%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%BC%81%E5%88%92.svg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10px;text-shadow:2px 2px 10px #2e5b92;\"><i><b>朽木妖<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B6%85%E7%BA%A7%E8%BF%9B%E5%8C%96ex%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"超級進化ex（TCG）\">超級進化</a>後的樣子</b></i></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:0.8em;height:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none\">\n<td colspan=\"2\" class=\"at-l\">\n<table width=\"40%\" class=\"a-r at-c\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: -webkit-linear-gradient(left,#110404 2%,#E02929 38%,#110404 60%);\" class=\"bd-OR bw-2 roundytl-60 textwhite\"><big><i><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A9%B6%E6%9E%81%E5%BC%82%E5%85%BD%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"究極異獸（TCG）\">究極異獸</a></i></big>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c bg- roundybr-30 roundyleft\" style=\"width:90%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"textwhite\" style=\"width:22%;\"><big><span class=\"lang-zh-\"></span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"></span></big>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundybr-30 roundytl textwhite\" style=\"font-size:0.9em;height:1em;background:#000;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\"></span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"><small></small></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><small></small></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy bd-草C textwhite\" style=\"background:#FFF; height:170px; border-width:3px; width:430px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SC1bF018.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/5/5a/SC1bF018.png/170px-SC1bF018.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"238\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/5/5a/SC1bF018.png/255px-SC1bF018.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/5/5a/SC1bF018.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"roundy-5 bg-白 bd-黑 textblack\" style=\"\"><small>全國圖鑑No.709&#160;&#160;老樹寶可夢&#160;&#160;身高:1.5m&#160;&#160;體重:71.0kg&#160;&#160;</small>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundy-5 bg-白 bd-黑 textblack\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<table width=\"95%\" class=\"bg-心金 roundy-5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"a-c at-l bd-黑 roundy-5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\" class=\"textwhite bgd-草C roundy-5\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">將自己手牌中2張朽木妖LEGEND加以組合，放置於備戰區。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">手札にある2枚の{{{jname}}}LEGENDを組み合わせて、ベンチに出す。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Put this card from your hand onto your Bench only with the other half of {{{ename}}} LEGEND.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table><table class=\"a-c\" style=\"width:95%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bw-3 roundy bl-钢\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-width:3px;color:initial;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"width:100px;font-size:1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%89%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"草（TCG）\"><img alt=\"草\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/20px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/30px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/40px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:100px;display:none;\" class=\"at-l\"><span class=\"bg-黑2 roundy-20 textwhite\"><b>&#160;&#160;招式&#160;&#160;</b></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.7em;\"><b><span class=\"lang-zh-\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%8D%E5%AD%90%E7%82%B8%E5%BC%B9%EF%BC%88%E6%8B%9B%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%89\" title=\"種子炸彈（招式）\">種子炸彈</a></span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">种子炸弹</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">タネばくだん</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Seed Bomb</span></b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-r\" style=\"font-size:1.6em;\"><b>40</b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.5em;width:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none\">\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);color:initial;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">zh-hans:;zh-hant:</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">zh-hans:;zh-hant:</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"a-c\" width=\"95%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"bw-3 roundy bl-钢\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-width:3px;color:initial;\" colspan=\"2\">\n<table style=\"width:100%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"width:100px;font-size:1.5em;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%89%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"草（TCG）\"><img alt=\"草\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/20px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/30px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/40px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8D%89%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"草（TCG）\"><img alt=\"草\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/20px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/30px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/c/c2/%E8%8D%89_TCG.png/40px-%E8%8D%89_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"無色（TCG）\"><img alt=\"無\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:100px;display:none;\" class=\"at-l\"><span class=\"bg-黑2 roundy-20 textwhite\"><b>&#160;&#160;招式&#160;&#160;</b></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.7em;\"><b><span class=\"lang-zh-\">暗影囚室</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">暗影小屋</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">シャドーコープ</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">Shadow Cage</span></b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-r\" style=\"font-size:1.6em;\"><b>120</b>\n</td>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"font-size:1.5em;width:1em;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"at-l\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);color:initial;\"><span class=\"lang-zh-\">在下個對手的回合，受到這個招式的寶可夢無法撤退。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">在下一个对手的回合，受到这个招式影响的宝可梦，无法撤退。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">次の相手の番、このワザを受けたポケモンは、にげられない。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">During your opponent's next turn, the Defending Pokémon can't retreat.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"100%\">\n<table style=\"color:initial;letter-spacing:0.2em;width:100%;white-space:nowrap;\" class=\"textblack\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundytl-30 b-钢 bgl-卡洛斯\" style=\"width:31%;\"><div class=\"at-r\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:0.8em;width:40%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%BC%B1%E7%82%B9%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"弱點（TCG）\">弱點</a></div> <div class=\"at-l\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:60%;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%81%AB%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"火（TCG）\"><img alt=\"火\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/f/ff/%E7%81%AB_TCG.png/20px-%E7%81%AB_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/f/ff/%E7%81%AB_TCG.png/30px-%E7%81%AB_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/f/ff/%E7%81%AB_TCG.png/40px-%E7%81%AB_TCG.png 2x\" /></a></span><b>×2</b></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundybr-30 b-钢 bgl-卡洛斯\" style=\"width:32%;\"><div class=\"at-r\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:0.8em;width:40%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%8A%B5%E6%8A%97%E5%8A%9B%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"抵抗力（TCG）\">抵抗力</a></div> <div class=\"at-l\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:60%;\"></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"roundytl-30 b-钢 bgl-卡洛斯\" style=\"width:37%;\"><span class=\"at-r\" style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:0.8em;width:30%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%92%A4%E9%80%80%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"撤退（TCG）\">撤退</a></span> <div class=\"at-l\" style=\"display:inline-block;width:70%;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//s1.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/20px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-loginonly-srcset=\"//media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/30px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 1.5x, //media.52poke.com/wiki/thumb/9/97/%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png/40px-%E6%97%A0%E8%89%B2_TCG.png 2x\" /></span></span></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table width=\"75%\" class=\"textblack roundytl-30 bl-卡洛斯 a-r at-l\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;&#160;<span class=\"lang-zh-\">人們懼怕牠，因為牠據說會吃掉砍倒森林裡樹木的人。但牠對住在森林裡的寶可夢很親切。</span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">人们惧怕它，因为它据说会吃掉砍倒森林里树木的人。但它对住在森林里的宝可梦很亲切。</span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">森の 木を 伐り倒す 人間を 食べると 恐れられているが 森で 暮らす ポケモンたちには 優しい。</span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">People fear it due to a belief that it devours any who try to cut down trees in its forest, but to the Pokémon it shares its woods with, it's kind.</span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"display:none;\">\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table width=\"100%\" class=\"roundy-10 at-l\" style=\"\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"roundy-10 roundybr-60 textblack\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;width:11em;\"><i><b>規則</b></i>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"textblack at-l\" colspan=\"2\"><div class=\"poem lang-zh-\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"宝可梦（TCG）\">寶可夢'''''</a><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%8F%E5%8E%A5%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"昏厥（TCG）\">昏厥</a></b>時，對手獲得<b>2</b>張<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%96%E8%B5%8F%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"奖赏卡（TCG）\">獎賞卡</a>。\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"poem lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none\">\n<p>当<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E5%8F%AF%E6%A2%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"宝可梦（TCG）\">宝可梦'''''</a><b><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%8F%E5%8E%A5%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" title=\"昏厥（TCG）\">昏厥</a></b>时，对手将拿取<b>2</b>张<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A5%96%E8%B5%8F%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%88TCG%EF%BC%89\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"奖赏卡（TCG）\">奖赏卡</a>。\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"poem lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\">\n<p>ポケモン'''''<b><i>が'</i>きぜつ</b>したとき、相手はサイドを<b>2</b>枚とる。\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"poem lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\">\n<p>When your Pokémon- is Knocked Out, your opponent takes 2 Prize cards.\n</p>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr><tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"100%\" class=\"roundybottom a-c at-c\" style=\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);color:initial;\">\n<p>語言切換：<span class=\"lang-zh-\"><b>繁</b> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-zh-alt- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-\">簡</span> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-ja- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-\">日</span> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-en- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-\">英</span></span><span class=\"lang-zh-alt-\" style=\"display:none;\"><span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-zh- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-alt-\">繁</span> | <b>簡</b> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-ja- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-alt-\">日</span> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-en- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-zh-alt-\">英</span></span><span class=\"lang-ja-\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-zh- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-ja-\">繁</span> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-zh-alt- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-ja-\">簡</span> | <b>日</b> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-en- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-ja-\">英</span></span><span class=\"lang-en-\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-zh- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-en-\">繁</span> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-zh-alt- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-en-\">簡</span> | <span class=\"&#95;toggle &#95;toggler&#95;show-lang-ja- &#95;toggler&#95;hide-lang-en-\">日</span> | <b>英</b></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".E6.94.B6.E5.BD.95.E5.8D.A1.E5.8C.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"收录卡包\"> 收錄卡包 </span></h2>\n<table class=\"a-c at-c bg-草C bd-草C roundy\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"16\" class=\"bg-草C roundytop\"><h3><span id=\".E4.B8.AD.E6.96.87.E5.8D.A1.E5.8C.85\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"中文卡包\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><b>中文卡包</b></span></span></h3>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"bgl-草C\">\n<th colspan=\"7\">簡體中文版\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"7\">繁體中文版\n</th>\n<th colspan=\"3\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"bgl-草C\">\n<th style=\"width:150px;\" colspan=\"2\">卡包\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:80px;\">系列\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:72px;\">時間\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:44px;\" class=\"textblack\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A8%80%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%A6%EF%BC%88TCG%E